WEBVTT

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:02.976
SORRY ABOUT THAT.

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:09.069
[DOOR CREAKING]

00:00:10.592 --> 00:00:12.899
I DEMAND THAT YOU
LEAVE AT ONCE, SIR!

00:00:12.942 --> 00:00:15.553
YOU ARE BREAKING
AND ENTERING!

00:00:15.597 --> 00:00:17.425
OHH.

00:00:17.468 --> 00:00:21.298
DRY UP, DURSLEY,
YOU GREAT PRUNE.

00:00:25.999 --> 00:00:28.697
MIND, I HAVEN'T SEEN YOU
SINCE YOU WAS A BABY, HARRY,

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:31.526
BUT YOU'RE A BIT MORE ALONG
THAN I WOULD'VE EXPECTED,

00:00:31.569 --> 00:00:33.093
PARTICULARLY
'ROUND THE MIDDLE.

00:00:33.136 --> 00:00:36.444
[GASPING]
I-I'M NOT HARRY.

00:00:39.142 --> 00:00:40.752
I--I AM.

00:00:40.796 --> 00:00:43.364
OH, WELL,
OF COURSE YOU ARE.

00:00:43.407 --> 00:00:45.801
GOT SOMETHING FOR YOU.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:48.195
'FRAID I MIGHT HAVE
SAT ON IT AT SOME POINT,

00:00:48.238 --> 00:00:51.502
BUT I IMAGINE IT'LL
TASTE FINE JUST THE SAME.

00:00:51.546 --> 00:00:53.896
AHH.

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:57.595
BAKED IT MYSELF,
WORDS AND ALL. HEH.

00:01:02.774 --> 00:01:03.993
THANK YOU.

00:01:04.037 --> 00:01:06.082
IT'S NOT EVERY DAY
YOUR YOUNG MAN TURNS 11,

00:01:06.126 --> 00:01:07.649
NOW IS IT, EH?

00:01:15.004 --> 00:01:17.006
[FIRE CRACKLING]

00:01:23.099 --> 00:01:26.189
EXCUSE ME, BUT...

00:01:26.233 --> 00:01:27.669
WHO ARE YOU?

00:01:27.712 --> 00:01:29.236
RUBEUS HAGRID,

00:01:29.279 --> 00:01:32.500
KEEPER OF KEYS AND
GROUNDS AT HOGWARTS.

00:01:32.543 --> 00:01:35.155
OF COURSE, YOU'LL KNOW
ALL ABOUT HOGWARTS.

00:01:35.198 --> 00:01:36.765
SORRY, NO.

00:01:36.808 --> 00:01:39.942
NO? BLIMEY, HARRY,
DIDN'T YOU EVER WONDER

00:01:39.986 --> 00:01:41.813
WHERE YOUR MUM AND DAD
LEARNED IT ALL?

00:01:41.857 --> 00:01:43.206
LEARNED WHAT?

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:46.079
YOU'RE A WIZARD, HARRY.

00:01:47.558 --> 00:01:48.908
I'M A WHAT?

00:01:48.951 --> 00:01:51.954
A WIZARD, AND A THUMPIN'
GOOD 'UN, I'D WAGER,

00:01:51.998 --> 00:01:53.216
ONCE YOU TRAIN UP
A LITTLE.

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:56.045
NO. YOU'VE MADE A MISTAKE.
I MEAN...

00:01:56.089 --> 00:01:59.483
I...CAN'T BE
A--A WIZARD.

00:01:59.527 --> 00:02:03.661
I MEAN,
I'M JUST...HARRY.

00:02:03.705 --> 00:02:04.967
JUST HARRY.

00:02:05.011 --> 00:02:07.927
WELL, JUST HARRY,

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:09.885
DID YOU EVER MAKE
ANYTHING HAPPEN,

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:11.060
ANYTHING YOU
COULDN'T EXPLAIN,

00:02:11.104 --> 00:02:13.976
WHEN YOU WERE
ANGRY OR SCARED?

00:02:16.674 --> 00:02:18.198
HMM.

00:02:19.677 --> 00:02:21.897
[DUDLEY WHIMPERING]

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:30.645
[OPENS ENVELOPE]

00:02:30.688 --> 00:02:32.647
Harry: "DEAR MR. POTTER,

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:35.476
"WE ARE PLEASED TO INFORM YOU
THAT YOU HAVE BEEN ACCEPTED

00:02:35.519 --> 00:02:37.695
AT HOGWARTS SCHOOL OF
WITCHCRAFT AND WIZARDRY."

00:02:37.739 --> 00:02:40.307
HE WILL NOT BE GOING,
I TELL YOU!

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:41.569
WE SWORE
WHEN WE TOOK HIM IN,

00:02:41.612 --> 00:02:43.049
WE'D PUT A STOP
TO ALL THIS RUBBISH!

00:02:43.092 --> 00:02:44.572
YOU KNEW?

00:02:44.615 --> 00:02:47.575
YOU KNEW ALL ALONG,
AND YOU NEVER TOLD ME?

00:02:47.618 --> 00:02:48.924
OF COURSE WE KNEW.

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.665
HOW COULD YOU NOT BE?

00:02:50.708 --> 00:02:53.973
MY PERFECTSISTER
BEING WHO SHE WAS.

00:02:54.016 --> 00:02:58.020
OH, MY MOTHER
AND FATHER WERE SO PROUD

00:02:58.064 --> 00:03:00.370
THE DAY SHE GOT
HER LETTER.

00:03:00.414 --> 00:03:02.459
"WE HAVE A WITCH
IN THE FAMILY.

00:03:02.503 --> 00:03:04.984
ISN'T IT WONDERFUL?"

00:03:05.027 --> 00:03:07.987
I WAS THE ONLY ONE TO SEE
HER FOR WHAT SHE WAS...

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:10.946
A FREAK!

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:12.730
AND THEN SHE MET
THAT POTTER,

00:03:12.774 --> 00:03:14.210
AND THEN SHE HAD YOU,

00:03:14.254 --> 00:03:15.864
AND I KNEW YOU WOULD
BE THE SAME,

00:03:15.907 --> 00:03:17.605
JUST AS STRANGE,

00:03:17.648 --> 00:03:20.173
JUST AS...ABNORMAL.

00:03:20.216 --> 00:03:21.696
AND THEN, IF YOU PLEASE,

00:03:21.739 --> 00:03:23.480
SHE WENT AND GOT
HERSELF BLOWN UP,

00:03:23.524 --> 00:03:25.656
AND WE GOT LANDED
WITH YOU.

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:27.049
BLOWN UP?

00:03:27.093 --> 00:03:29.747
YOU TOLD ME MY PARENTS
DIED IN A CAR CRASH!

00:03:29.791 --> 00:03:31.314
A CAR CRASH?!

00:03:31.358 --> 00:03:34.056
A CAR CRASH KILL
LILY AND JAMES POTTER?

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.101
Petunia: WE HAD
TO SAY SOMETHING.

00:03:35.144 --> 00:03:36.885
IT'S AN OUTRAGE!

00:03:36.928 --> 00:03:37.973
IT'S A SCANDAL!

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:39.888
HE'LL NOT BE GOING.

00:03:39.931 --> 00:03:43.370
OH? AND I SUPPOSE
A GREAT MUGGLE LIKE YOURSELF

00:03:43.413 --> 00:03:44.632
IS GONNA STOP HIM,
ARE YOU?

00:03:44.675 --> 00:03:45.633
MUGGLE?

00:03:45.676 --> 00:03:47.113
NON-MAGIC FOLK.

00:03:47.156 --> 00:03:49.680
THIS BOY'S HAD HIS NAME DOWN
EVER SINCE HE WERE BORN!

00:03:49.724 --> 00:03:51.334
HE'S GOING
TO THE FINEST SCHOOL

00:03:51.378 --> 00:03:53.554
OF WITCHCRAFT AND WIZARDRY
IN THE WORLD,

00:03:53.597 --> 00:03:56.122
AND HE'LL BE UNDER
THE FINEST HEADMASTER

00:03:56.165 --> 00:03:57.993
THAT HOGWARTS
HAS EVER SEEN...

00:03:58.037 --> 00:04:00.213
ALBUS DUMBLEDORE.

00:04:00.256 --> 00:04:02.476
I'LL NOT PAY TO HAVE
SOME CRACKPOT OLD FOOL

00:04:02.519 --> 00:04:04.347
TEACH HIM MAGIC TRICKS!

00:04:04.391 --> 00:04:09.526
NEVER...INSULT
ALBUS DUMBLEDORE

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:11.311
IN FRONT OF ME.

00:04:12.312 --> 00:04:15.010
[SLURPING]

00:04:17.882 --> 00:04:18.840
OH!

00:04:18.883 --> 00:04:21.886
[YELLING]

00:04:26.804 --> 00:04:28.806
[DUDLEY SOBBING]

00:04:29.938 --> 00:04:31.635
WELL, AHEM,
I'D APPRECIATE IT

00:04:31.679 --> 00:04:35.117
IF YOU DIDN'T TELL ANYONE
AT HOGWARTS ABOUT THAT.

00:04:35.161 --> 00:04:37.598
STRICTLY SPEAKING,
I'M NOT ALLOWED TO DO MAGIC.

00:04:37.641 --> 00:04:39.295
OK.

00:04:39.339 --> 00:04:42.385
OOH, WE'RE A BIT
BEHIND SCHEDULE.

00:04:42.429 --> 00:04:44.083
BEST BE OFF.

00:04:47.738 --> 00:04:49.827
[THUD]

00:04:49.871 --> 00:04:52.308
UNLESS YOU'D RATHER STAY,
OF COURSE.

00:04:52.352 --> 00:04:54.136
HMM?

00:04:56.486 --> 00:04:58.488
[THUNDER]

00:05:07.236 --> 00:05:10.892
Harry: "ALL STUDENTS
MUST BE EQUIPPED WITH...

00:05:10.935 --> 00:05:13.808
"ONE STANDARD
SIZE 2 PEWTER CAULDRON

00:05:13.851 --> 00:05:16.202
"AND MAY BRING,
IF THEY DESIRE,

00:05:16.245 --> 00:05:19.074
EITHER AN OWL,
A CAT, OR A TOAD."

00:05:19.118 --> 00:05:21.816
CAN WE FIND ALL THIS
IN LONDON?

00:05:21.859 --> 00:05:24.040
IF YOU KNOW WHERE TO GO.

